# Everything in this repo is deployed to an OpenWrt router and run there.
# A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite these to CRLF,
# and a shell script whose shebang line ends in \r fails on the device with
# a bare "bad interpreter" -- so pin the line endings rather than leaving
# it to whatever each clone happens to be configured with.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf

# init.d services and the opkg maintainer scripts have no extension
init.d/*             text eol=lf
packages/control/*   text eol=lf

*.png   binary
